error[E1260]: `@section` name contains a character that cannot be written in LLVM IR
 --> lib/s.kg:7:1
  |
7 | @section("bad\"quote") //~ ERROR cannot be written in LLVM IR
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  = help: use printable ASCII without a quote or backslash

error[E1260]: `@section` name contains a character that cannot be written in LLVM IR
  --> lib/s.kg:10:1
   |
10 | @section("bad\ttab") //~ ERROR cannot be written in LLVM IR
